<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>9.3.3: Solve by Completing the Square</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02372</md:content-id>
    <md:title>9.3.3: Solve by Completing the Square</md:title>
    <md:uuid>a7239fcd-6d35-46de-a871-92901b01f1f0</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section id="sect-00001">
      <title>Activity</title>
      <para id="para-00001">Here are four equations followed by worked solutions of the equations. Each solution has at least one error.</para>
      <exercise id="exer-00001">
        <problem id="prob-00001">
          <para id="para-00002">Solve the equation <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>. Then look at the following worked solution (with errors) and find and describe the error or errors in the worked solution.</para>
          <para id="para-00003"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 1 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>28</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 2 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 3 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 4 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 5 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mtext> and </m:mtext><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 6 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00001">
          <para id="para-00004">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          <para id="para-00005">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00006"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
    </section>
    <section id="sect-00002">
      <title>Activity</title>
      <para id="para-00007">Here are four equations followed by worked solutions of the equations. Each solution has at least one error.</para>
      <exercise id="exer-00002">
        <problem id="prob-00002">
          <para id="para-00008">Where was the error made in the worked solution above and what was the error?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00002">
          <para id="para-00009">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          <para id="para-00010">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00011">Error: In Step 2, the number being added, 28, is not a <term class="glossary-tooltip" id="term-00001">perfect square</term>. It should be 49.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="exer-00003">
        <problem id="prob-00003">
          <para id="para-00012">Solve the equation <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>. Then look at the following worked solution (with errors) and find and describe the error or errors in the worked solution.</para>
          <para id="para-00013"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 1 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 2 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 3 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 4 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 5 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext> and </m:mtext><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 6 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00003">
          <para id="para-00014">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          <para id="para-00015">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00016"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="exer-00004">
        <problem id="prob-00004">
          <para id="para-00017">Where was the error made in the worked solution above and what was the error?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00004">
          <para id="para-00018">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          <para id="para-00019">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00020">Errors: Step 4 should have 3 on the right side, not 9. Step 5 should have -3 on the right side, not -9.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="exer-00005">
        <problem id="prob-00005">
          <para id="para-00021">Solve the equation <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2.4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>. Then look at the following worked solution (with errors) and find and describe the error or errors in the worked solution.</para>
          <para id="para-00022"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2.4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.8</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mtext> Step 1</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"/></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2.4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1.44</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.64</m:mn><m:mspace width="1em"/><m:mtext>Step 2</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"/></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1.2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.64</m:mn><m:mspace width="1em"/><m:mtext>Step 3</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"/></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1.2</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.8</m:mn><m:mspace width="1em"/><m:mtext>Step 4</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"/></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00005">
          <para id="para-00023">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          <para id="para-00024">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00025"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="exer-00006">
        <problem id="prob-00006">
          <para id="para-00026">Where was the error made in the worked solution above and what was the error?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00006">
          <para id="para-00027">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          <para id="para-00028">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00029">Error: In Step 4, only the positive square root is written and the negative square root is neglected.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="exer-00007">
        <problem id="prob-00007">
          <para id="para-00030">Solve the equation <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>. Then look at the following worked solution (with errors) and find and describe the error or errors in the worked solution.</para>
          <para id="para-00031"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 1 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 2 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 3 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 4 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 5 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> and </m:mtext><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mtext> Step 6 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00007">
          <para id="para-00032">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          <para id="para-00033">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00034"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="exer-00008">
        <problem id="prob-00008">
          <para id="para-00035">Where was the error made in the worked solution above and what was the error?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00008">
          <para id="para-00036">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          <para id="para-00037">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00038">Errors: For example: In Step 2, different amounts are added to each side. On the left, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> is added. On the right, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> is added. Or: While <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> is added on the right side, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> was only subtracted from the left side. Other explanations may also be accurate.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
    </section>
    <note class="self-check" id="note-00001"><exercise id="exer-00010">
      <problem id="prob-00010">
      <para id="para-00039"><link class="os-embed" url="#exercise/Alg1_9_3_3_SC"/></para>
      </problem>
      </exercise>
     </note>
    <section id="sect-00003">
      <title>Additional Resources</title>
      <section id="sect-00004">
        <title>Spotting the Error When Solving Quadratics</title>
        <para id="para-00046">To find the error when solving quadratics, it is helpful to first solve the problem on your own.</para>
        <para id="para-00047">Solve the quadratic equation by <term class="glossary-tooltip" id="term-00002">completing the square</term> and finding its zeros. Identify the error in the worked solution below.</para>
        <para id="para-00048"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>34</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext> Step 1 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>34</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext> Step 2 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>34</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext> Step 3 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext> Step 4 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext> Step 5 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext> Step 6 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00049">Now, find the error by working through the problem and comparing steps:</para>
        <para id="para-00050"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>34</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext> Step 1 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>34</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext> Step 2 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>34</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext> Step 3 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00051">In Step 3, 25 was added to the left side of the equation, but 25 was SUBTRACTED from the right side of the equation. Equations must remain balanced, and 25 should be added to each side of the equation.</para>
        <note class="try" id="note-00002">
          <title>Try It: Spotting the Error When Solving Quadratics</title>
            <exercise id="exer-00009">
              <problem id="prob-00009">
                <para id="para-00052">Examine the steps below and identify the error in solving the quadratic equation by completing the square:</para>
                <para id="para-00053"><m:math xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mtext> Step 1 </m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mtext> Step 2 </m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mtext> Step 3 </m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mtext> Step 4 </m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mtext> Step 5 </m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mtext> Step 6 </m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></para>
                <para id="para-00054">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
              </problem>
              <solution id="sol-00009">
                <para id="para-00055">Here is how to find the error when completing the square:</para>
                <para id="para-00056">Work through the steps on your own and compare:</para>
                <para id="para-00057"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext> Step 1 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext> Step 2 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext> Step 3 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext> Step 4 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext> Step 5 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext> Step 6 </m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00058">The error occurred in Step 5 when the plus-minus sign was not included after taking the square root of each side. This led to the second possible equation not being written.</para>
              </solution>
            </exercise>
        </note>
      </section>
    </section>
  </content>
</document>